 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "But... it is a relief knowing you're not\non their side. Believe it or not.": "",
  "But... now I know you're not part of AD-9's web.\nKind of a relief, really.": "",
  "Heh, not sure this is\nthe time to be relieved.": "",
  "I'd say it's too\nearly to breathe easy.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There has to still be something\nwe can do before Ayabe's trial.)</color>": "",
  "I was wondering... you think we could get Ichinose\nto testify? Get him called to the stand?": "",
  "I was wondering... you think we could get\nIchinose to testify? Call him to the stand.": "",
  "Under what pretense?": "",
  "I dunno. Maybe to explain AD-9?\nIt could be anything, really.": "",
  "I dunno... maybe to explain AD-9,\nor something innocuous like that.": "",
  "He can't say no if the prosecution\nrequests him, right?": "",
  "If the prosecution requests him specifically,\nit's not like he can say no.": "",
  "Then? What do we do once\nwe have him there?": "",
  "And? Once we have him there?": "",
  "We corner him, eloquently. Shower him with questions\nuntil he gives up. Me and you both.": "",
  "Wait, that's your big plan?": "",
  "Really? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>That</font_kind> is your big plan?": "",
  "Hey, desperate times\ncall for desperate measures!": "",
  "Desperate measures for desperate times.": "",
  "We don't have a chance of winning\nif we're not willing to take some risks.": "",
  "If we don't take some risks... we don't\nstand a chance at winning this thing.": "",
  "Okay, I'm in. I'll let you know\nonce I've made the arrangements.": "",
  "...Okay. I'll figure something out.\nOnce it's set, I'll call you.": "",
  "What a day...": "",
  "So basically, it's up to Izumida\nwhether or not Ichinose shows at the trial.": "",
  "So now, we might get Ichinose at Ayabe's trial.\nBut that's up to Izumida.": "",
  "The question now is, how do we\npress Ichinose once he's there...?": "",
  "Question is, how do we press Ichinose\nonce he's there...?": "",
  "Before we get too far...": "",
  "I have an announcement first.": "",
  "Genda-sensei and Ayabe are both on board\nwith Yagami-san representing the defense.": "",
  "Both Genda-sensei and Detective Ayabe have accepted\nYagami-san as the attorney.": "",
  "The lousiest lawyer ever,\nback in the court.": "",
  "Return of the lousiest lawyer ever.": "",
  "Looks like it. Now, let's talk about\nour next steps. First on the agenda, though...": "",
  "Looks like it. Now, we'd better get to our next steps,\nso first up is...": "",
  "What do we call Sugiura now?": "",
  "That's your \"next step\"?\nIt was, uh... Terasawa, yeah?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>That's</font_kind> your \"next step\"?\nIt was, uh... Terasawa, yeah?": "",
  "I'm fine with Sugiura.\nWhy change it up now?": "",
  "I'm fine with Sugiura.\nDoesn't have to be an issue.": "",
  "Um... speaking of next steps.": "",
  "Um... speaking of our next steps...": "",
  "I'd like to try putting\nsome pressure on Kido again.": "",
  "I'd like to try pressing Kido again.": "",
  "Maybe we could use the video Saori-san\nhelped us get to force him into testifying for us.": "",
  "Since Saori-san got us that video,\nmaybe we could get him to testify.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(True, if we could get Kido on our side\nhe'd be a powerful witness.)</color>": "",
  "Good plan. Anyone else?": "",
  "Good idea. Anything else?": "",
  "This doesn't have anything to do with the case,\nbut some shit's goin' down in the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "We can talk about it right\nafter this, Yagami.": "",
  "I'll tell you later, once you're done talkin'.": "",
  "Roger that.": "",
  "Just so you know...\nI'm gonna go talk to Okubo soon.": "",
  "Just something you should know...\nI'm going to see Okubo-kun.": "",
  "He still thinks Emi-chan's family\nhates him for what happened.": "",
  "In his mind, Emi-chan's family still\nhates him for what happened.": "",
  "I need him to know that's not true.\nIf that's okay with you.": "",
  "But that's not true, and\nI need him to know that.": "",
  "Sure. I'm fine with it.": "",
  "...Yeah. Just lemme know.": "",
  "You said something's going down\nwith the Matsugane Family?": "",
  "So what was it? Something's going down\nwith the Matsugane?": "",
  "Yup. It's all pretty much gone to shit.": "",
  "Right. The family's pretty much\ngone to shit.": "",
  "After the patriarch died, everyone just kinda\nwent their separate ways. Especially the younger guys.": "",
  "After the patriarch died, everyone just kinda went their\nseparate ways. Especially the younger guys.": "",
  "Is anyone trying to hold the family together?": "",
  "Anyone trying to keep the peace?": "",
  "Guy named Kengo, yeah. You beat the stuffing\noutta him once or twice, remember?": "",
  "Guy named Kengo, yeah. He's doin' his best.\nYou kicked his ass once or twice.": "",
  "He was one of Captain Hamura's golden boys.": "",
  "He was one of Captain Hamura's\ngolden boys.": "",
  "There's kinda somethin' up with him, though.": "",
  "But... he's changed.\nSomething's up with him.": "",
  "You'll see when we get there.\nWanna tag along?": "",
  "Well? You wanna check\non the family with me?": "",
  "Well? Wanna come check on\nthe Matsugane?": "",
  "(I told Hoshino-kun I'd go to the ADDC with him.\nBut maybe I should do this first?)": "",
  "(I told Sugiura I'd go visit Okubo.\nBut maybe I should do this first?)": "",
  "Sure. Let's do it.": "",
  "Not just yet, sorry.": "",
  "Nah, not just yet.": "",
  "I'd like to talk to Kido if possible.\nHe'd make a valuable witness in Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "As for me, I'd like to talk to Kido.\nHe'd make a valuable witness in Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "We've got some dirt on him, too.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks to Saori-san's\nlittle adventure.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks to Saori-san's hard work.": "",
  "He won't be able to turn us away\nonce we remind him of that.": "",
  "Once we remind him about that,\nKido can't just turn us away.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nAre you ready to go to the ADDC?": "",
  "Yagami-san? Are you ready to\ngo to the ADDC?": "",
  "(I told Higashi I'd go check out the Matsugane with him.\nBut maybe I should do this first?)": "",
  "You wanna go see Okubo, Yagami-san?": "",
  "You gonna go see Okubo,\nYagami-san?": "",
  "Yeah. I wish you could come too,\nbut civilians can't get that kind of clearance.": "",
  "Yeah. I wish you could come too,\nbut clearance is restricted...": "",
  "It's okay. It is how it is.": "",
  "You ready to see Okubo...?": "",
  "Yeah, it's time to clear the air.": "",
  "Yeah. I'm heading out.": "",
  "I hear you're returning to the courtroom, Yagami-san.\nLet me know if I can help in any way.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I hear you're returning to the courtroom.\nIf there's any way I can help, just say so.": "",
  "Well look who it is.": "",
  "Well, look who it is.": "",
  "Hey, Genda-sensei?\nAbout Ayabe's trial...": "",
  "Yeah. Uh... About Ayabe's trial\ncoming up...": "",
  "Hoshino-kun told me everything. You're finally\ncoming back after these three long years.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun told me everything. You're finally coming back\nafter these three long years... Do us proud.": "",
  "I know it's kinda late\nto say this now, but... sorry.": "",
  "Well... I know it's kinda late\nto say this now, but... sorry.": "",
  "Eh, don't worry about it. I've honestly\nbeen waiting for this day to come.": "",
  "Eh... look, don't worry about it.\nI've honestly been waiting for the day to come.": "",
  "It's about time you made peace with your past.": "",
  "It's about time you made peace\nwith your past.": "",
  "Go avenge Shintani for us.": "",
  "Well, it's up to you.\nGo avenge Shintani for us.": "",
  "I will. Matsugane-san, too.": "",
  "For Matsugane-san, too.": "",
  "Yeah... Damn right.": "",
  "This damn drug has taken\nfar too many lives...": "",
  "This damn drug's taken too many lives.\nThis AD-9...": "",
  "Let's put an end to it once and for all.": "",
  "C'mon. Let's put an end to it.": "",
  "Sorry for askin' you to do this,\nYagami. The family's a real mess right now.": "",
  "Sorry for askin' you to do this.\nThe family's... a real mess right now.": "",
  "Sure you don't wanna\nbring Kaito-san along?": "",
  "Sure you don't wanna bring\nKaito-san along?": "",
  "He got expelled, remember?\nThey wouldn't even let him through the door.": "",
  "Anyway, let's go.\nDoubt I can stop 'em all on my own.": "",
  "Anyway, let's go. Don't think I can\nstop 'em on my own.": "",
  "Stop them?\nWhat do you mean?": "",
  "...Stop them?\nWhat do you mean?": "",
  "Just c'mon.": "",
  "Yo, Kengo.": "",
  "Higashi-aniki. Finally went n' brought\nme Yagami-san, hm?": "",
  "Higashi-aniki. Finally got me the man himself, huh?\nYagami-san.": "",
  "Easy. It's okay.": "",
  "Need something from me?": "",
  "What do you want with me?": "",
  "Our patriarch is dead. And I hear you've\ngot the scoop on who did it.": "",
  "Our patriarch's dead. And I hear\nyou know who did it.": "",
  "You know who the Mole is.\nAnd I want you to tell us.": "",
  "How 'bout it? You know who the Mole is.\nSo I want you to tell us.": "",
  "So you want revenge.": "",
  "You want your revenge?": "",
  "We don't just want it. We need to get it.\nAll part of bein' a yakuza.": "",
  "Nah, we don't want it. We <font_kind=yakuza_italic>need</font_kind> it.\nJust part of bein' a yakuza.": "",
  "We're gonna massacre\nthe son of a bitch!": "",
  "We'll massacre the son of a bitch!": "",
  "You can't handle it.": "",
  "The fuck you say to me!?": "",
  "I've told 'em that already,\nbut they won't listen.": "",
  "It's in one ear, out the next here.": "",
  "So... what do you want me to do?": "",
  "And you want me\nto do what, exactly?": "",
  "I mean, you're a lawyer, yeah?\nIsn't persuasion your job?": "",
  "A lawyer persuades, right?\nSo persuade 'em.": "",
  "You can't worm your way outta this.\nTell us who the Mole is.": "",
  "You can't worm your way outta this.\nWe want the Mole, so start talking.": "",
  "Or do you need a little encouragement?": "",
  "Kengo!": "",
  "I'm rebuildin' this family one way or another.\nNow stand the fuck down, Aniki!": "",
  "Matsugane's gone... but I'm saving this family.\nNow stand the fuck down, Aniki!": "",
  "You... goddamn...": "",
  "All right. If you wanna know\nthat bad... I'll tell you.": "",
  "If you wanna know the Mole's identity\nthat bad... I'll tell you.": "",
  "Kuroiwa. From the Tokyo PD.\nOrganized crime.": "",
  "A Kamurocho cop. Organized Crime Division.\nName's Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Bastard's a cop...?": "",
  "It doesn't end with him, though. Kuroiwa's just a tool\nfor the people really behind all this.": "",
  "But you should know... It doesn't end with him.\nKuroiwa's just a tool for the people really behind all this.": "",
  "They're not afraid of some small-time\nyakuza thugs.": "",
  "Guys like him? They're not afraid of some\nthird-string yakuza thugs.": "",
  "That's why I'm gonna\nbeat them myself, in court.": "",
  "That's why I'm gonna beat them\nmyself, in court.": "",
  "You? You seriously think you can do that?": "",
  "You? You think... you're gonna take...\nthis Kuroiwa guy...?": "",
  "Matsugane-san was like a father to me, for the last\n20 years. I knew him longer than you guys.": "",
  "Matsugane-san was like a father to me,\nfor twenty good years. I knew him longer than you guys.": "",
  "I want revenge as bad as you. Maybe more.\nCan you let me handle this one?": "",
  "So... I want revenge for the old man, too.\nCan you let me handle this one?": "",
  "I owe you one, Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami... I owe you one.": "",
  "Don't mention it. Later.": "",
  "Killin' Kuroiwa wouldn't accomplish shit.\nHe's just the tip of this whole fucked up iceberg.": "",
  "Killin' Kuroiwa wouldn't accomplish shit.\nWe need the guys pulling the strings.": "",
  "Let Yagami do this.": "",
  "Let Yagami handle this.": "",
  "You might even wanna\nconsider helpin' him.": "",
  "If you wanna help,\nI'm sure he could use it.": "",
  "Sorry Higashi pulled you into that.": "",
  "Sorry Higashi dragged you into that. ": "",
  "Were you spying on me?": "",
  "...Were you spying on me?": "",
  "Not too hard when you've got a drone.": "",
  "I mean... I've got a drone.": "",
  "I guess not, no.": "",
  "Ha, you got me there.": "",
  "Anyways, with Matsugane-san gone, the family's\nbeen driftin' in the wind like a kite without a string.": "",
  "Now that Matsugane-san's gone, the family's driftin'.\nLike a kite with its string cut.": "",
  "Looks like you brought 'em\nback down to Earth, though.": "",
  "From the looks of that mess upstairs, though,\nyou brought 'em back down.": "",
  "Thanks, man.": "",
  "You hit your head or something?": "",
  "Hey, how hard did they hit you?": "",
  "Yeah, yeah, make your jokes.\nJust don't say I never said it.": "",
  "Sure, make your jokes.\nJust don't say I never said it.": "",
  "We'll need to take a taxi\nto the ADDC, right?": "",
  "We'll need a taxi to take us\nto the ADDC.": "",
  "I knew it would all work out.": "",
  "Hm? What would?": "",
  "Seeing Kido without an appointment.\nThat video has some serious power.": "",
  "You can thank Saori-san for that.": "",
  "Thank Saori-san for that.": "",
  "Afternoon.": "",
  "...Hi.": "",
  "Sorry to barge in.": "",
  "Sorry for the imposition.": "",
  "We know you're busy.": "",
  "We know you're a busy man.": "",
  "Please, sit.": "",
  "Well...\nLet's get straight to the point.": "",
  "We'd like to call you to the stand\nas a witness in Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "Kido-san, we want you to be a witness for us\nat Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "That's not possible.": "",
  "Would this change your mind?": "",
  "Does this change things?": "",
  "Do what you will.": "",
  "Wait... really?": "",
  "Ichinose is unstoppable,\nand my testimony won't change that.": "",
  "Ichinose is unstoppable, and my testimony\nwon't change that.": "",
  "You're up against everyone who stands to gain from AD-9.\nIncluding patients who it would save and their families.": "",
  "You're up against everyone who stands to gain from AD-9.\nThat includes the patients it would save and their families.": "",
  "You can't win.": "",
  "Not how things stand, no.\nBut that's exactly why we need your testimony.": "",
  "Not how things stand, no. But that's exactly why\nwe need your testimony.": "",
  "I have no obligation to help you.\nIf you truly want to release the video, release it.": "",
  "I have no obligation to help you.\nAnd the video...? Release it if you want.": "",
  "You are aware of the consequences\nthat would have, right?": "",
  "If we upload that, do you realize\nwhat'll happen?": "",
  "I'll become the laughing stock of\nthe scientific world. My career will be over.": "",
  "I'll be a laughingstock. My industry will denounce me.\nMy career will be over.": "",
  "But I'd rather that than make an enemy\nof Ichinose. I'm not ready to die just yet.": "",
  "But... I'd rather that than make an enemy of Ichinose.\nI'm not ready to die just yet.": "",
  "Are you really that scared of him?": "",
  "There's no doubt in your mind?\nYou're that scared of Ichinose?": "",
  "Of course. Losing my job is a much more appealing\nproposal than losing my life.": "",
  "Of course. I can accept losing my job, if I must...\nI still want to live, though.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Roger that.": "รับทราบ",
  "Sure. Let's do it.": "ได้สิ ไปกันเลย",
  "Nah, not just yet.": "ไม่ ยังก่อน",
  "What do you want with me?": "แกต้องการอะไรจากฉัน?",
  "Thanks, man.": "ขอบใจนะเพื่อน",
  "Wait... really?": "เดี๋ยวนะ... จริงเหรอ?"
 }
}
